:10.770" end="00:10.770">, </span><span begin="00:10.770" end="00:11.070">I </span><span begin="00:11.070" end="00:11.310">could </span><span begin="00:11.310" end="00:11.760">come </span><span begin="00:11.760" end="00:12.120">by</span><span begin="00:12.120" end="00:12.150">, </span><span begin="00:12.150" end="00:12.840">help </span><span begin="00:12.840" end="00:13.440">forget </span><span begin="00:13.440" end="00:13.620">it </span><span begin="00:13.620" end="00:14.070">all</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.100" end="00:17.670"><span begin="00:14.100" end="00:14.490">'Cause </span><span begin="00:14.490" end="00:14.670">in </span><span begin="00:14.670" end="00:14.760">this </span><span begin="00:14.760" end="00:15.270">sticky </span><span begin="00:15.270" end="00:15.840">weather</span><span begin="00:15.840" end="00:15.840">, </span><span begin="00:15.840" end="00:15.990">oh</span><span begin="00:15.990" end="00:15.990">, </span><span begin="00:15.990" end="00:16.230">it's </span><span begin="00:16.230" end="00:16.650">really </span><span begin="00:16.650" end="00:16.860">hard </span><span begin="00:16.860" end="00:16.980">to </span><span begin="00:16.980" end="00:17.610">sleep</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.670" end="00:21.270"><span begin="00:17.670" end="00:18.000">As </span><span begin="00:18.000" end="00:18.330">you </span><span begin="00:18.330" end="00:18.750">know </span><span begin="00:18.750" end="00:19.140"> </span><span begin="00:19.140" end="00:19.980">too </span><span begin="00:19.980" end="00:20.640">well</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.270" end="00:24.690"><span begin="00:21.270" end="00:21.540">And </span><span begin="00:21.540" end="00:21.690">when </span><span begin="00:21.690" end="00:21.900">we </span><span begin="00:21.900" end="00:22.110">dig </span><span begin="00:22.110" end="00:22.890">together</span><span begin="00:22.890" end="00:22.890">, </span><span begin="00:22.890" end="00:23.010">oh</span><span begin="00:23.010" end="00:23.010">, </span><span begin="00:23.010" end="00:23.190">you </span><span begin="00:23.190" end="00:23.490">make </span><span begin="00:23.490" end="00:23.610">me </span><span begin="00:23.610" end="00:23.820">feel </span><span begin="00:23.820" end="00:24.060">so </span><span begin="00:24.060" end="00:24.660">cheap</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.690" end="00:28.770"><span begin="00:24.690" end="00:25.110">But </span><span begin="00:25.110" end="00:25.350">I </span><span begin="00:25.350" end="00:25.860">can't </span><span begin="00:25.860" end="00:26.280">help </span><span begin="00:26.280" end="00:28.140">myself</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.770" end="00:33.990"><span begin="00:28.770" end="00:29.940">Filthy </span><span begin="00:29.940" end="00:30.240">and </span><span begin="00:30.240" end="00:31.410">petulant </span><span begin="00:31.410" end="00:33.630">soul</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.990" end="00:37.500"><span begin="00:33.990" end="00:34.260">I </span><span begin="00:34.260" end="00:34.680">wanna </span><span begin="00:34.680" end="00:35.010">give </span><span begin="00:35.010" end="00:35.130">it </span><span begin="00:35.130" end="00:35.400">to </span><span begin="00:35.400" end="00:37.200">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.500" end="00:40.170"><span begin="00:37.500" end="00:37.800">I'll </span><span begin="00:37.800" end="00:38.070">just </span><span begin="00:38.070" end="00:38.490">unsee </span><span begin="00:38.490" end="00:38.760">what </span><span begin="00:38.760" end="00:39.060">you </span><span begin="00:39.060" end="00:40.140">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.170" end="00:43.080"><span begin="00:40.170" end="00:40.560">'Cause </span><span begin="00:40.560" end="00:40.800">I'm </span><span begin="00:40.800" end="00:41.250">so </span><span begin="00:41.250" end="00:41.850">drunk </span><span begin="00:41.850" end="00:42.210">on </span><span begin="00:42.210" end="00: